{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_b22d0316aaa81831498e8675d4894f0362fad00469007437eb218765b3a30bd0"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: CLAUDE.md instructs that the deposit skill builds a Swapper deeplink with a hardcoded integratorId, uses the zero address for native tokens, and that agents must display the full deeplink URL, never auto-approve transactions, surface fees and risks, and never store or access private keys."}],"claim_ids":["clm_b22d0316aaa81831498e8675d4894f0362fad00469007437eb218765b3a30bd0"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:24:40Z","created_by_operation":"op_a62ba7d8262846e090b9fb069276df7a","id":"pg_3ba6fbc19de15e759cd52939586400c8","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/swapperfinance-swapper-toolkit-claude-md-deb74c56d9db-2939586400c8.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_6c177a8e26ac5c65abc4af03c37a5bd8"],"title":"swapperfinance/swapper-toolkit/CLAUDE.md @ deb74c56d9db","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:24:40Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a62ba7d8262846e090b9fb069276df7a"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_31b6a4b0c1ce574ed9ae994fa86be01b29cc059c9729b7bd3f4c6cf0a0dc36f1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The product relies on Chainlink CRE for deposit/compliance/settlement orchestration, Chainlink CCIP for cross-chain interoperability (60+ blockchains), and Mastercard for card processing in 170+ countries."},{"claim_ids":["clm_4a11d99b58dee6a10a0333147bc03c3d6c71d737e65e2e519732872f43bab6b4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The toolkit is installed into agents via 'npx skills add swapperfinance/swapper-toolkit' and advertises compatibility with Claude Code, Cursor, Windsurf, Copilot, CrewAI, AutoGPT and any framework supporting the open skills standard."},{"claim_ids":["clm_585e6782acb0c8494b60f8ead209e8e776a125511b6395d26a10a26c25e7de39"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Supported deposit chains are listed as Ethereum, Base, Arbitrum, Optimism, Polygon, Fast, Solana, HyperEVM, BNB Chain and Avalanche."},{"claim_ids":["clm_59aaa9bbd5212179867626b3db6ed82760c0a176ba749c657a5cc315806b8449"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The deposit flow is link-based: the skill generates a deposit link for browser confirmation rather than executing transactions itself, and every transaction requires explicit user approval with fees and risks surfaced beforehand."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5edadca7d368cae93da13666235d11c6f318f95953cb3e95712d699b44c82618"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"An npm SDK, @swapper-finance/deposit-sdk, exposes openSwapperModal accepting integratorId, destination chain ID and token address, deposit wallet address, theme styles, and supported deposit options like transferCrypto and depositWithCash."},{"claim_ids":["clm_a09cd3ad3b5258c6d7805f362061e65343fbc6c9c74d2e450adffbd5873e284b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The toolkit states private keys are never stored or accessed and transactions are never auto-approved."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b6103ce019f3f96fba8e601eb08f91fc6d96b77fd6b98f7b6c894b1da705805c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Deposits support direct transfers to any wallet address, cross-chain bridging via CCIP, protocol deposits into lending, staking and liquidity pools, and fiat on-ramps via Mastercard, Visa, Apple Pay and Google Pay."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e721df561eeacba4c47142f3afc0c9ab6b09088d17ef1c3cac5edbc580a469d9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"An example deposit interaction shows the skill resolving chain (Base 8453), token (USDC), protocol (Aave) and amount, then producing a deposit link the user confirms in a browser."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f68e3fc9817198e49428809fe178d0caca78ea8295accdf2c2b0749680d9df01"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The /swapper-deposit skill triggers when a user asks to deposit, fund, top-up or bridge assets, when an agent detects insufficient wallet funds mid-task, or when fiat-to-crypto funding is wanted before a strategy."}],"claim_ids":["clm_31b6a4b0c1ce574ed9ae994fa86be01b29cc059c9729b7bd3f4c6cf0a0dc36f1","clm_4a11d99b58dee6a10a0333147bc03c3d6c71d737e65e2e519732872f43bab6b4","clm_585e6782acb0c8494b60f8ead209e8e776a125511b6395d26a10a26c25e7de39","clm_59aaa9bbd5212179867626b3db6ed82760c0a176ba749c657a5cc315806b8449","clm_5edadca7d368cae93da13666235d11c6f318f95953cb3e95712d699b44c82618","clm_a09cd3ad3b5258c6d7805f362061e65343fbc6c9c74d2e450adffbd5873e284b","clm_b6103ce019f3f96fba8e601eb08f91fc6d96b77fd6b98f7b6c894b1da705805c","clm_e721df561eeacba4c47142f3afc0c9ab6b09088d17ef1c3cac5edbc580a469d9","clm_f68e3fc9817198e49428809fe178d0caca78ea8295accdf2c2b0749680d9df01"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:24:40Z","created_by_operation":"op_a62ba7d8262846e090b9fb069276df7a","id":"pg_502bf40b1c02572c883a5643e415de20","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/swapperfinance-swapper-toolkit-readme-md-deb74c56d9db-5643e415de20.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_2d56c04eca73554e98f71095f3f89c10"],"title":"swapperfinance/swapper-toolkit/README.md @ deb7